{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
The sons of Joseph [Gm7]spoke to Joshua,
[C]Saying why one lot for [Fmaj7]us today,
[Bb]We are a numerous [Gm7]and blessed people,
[Am]Yet we receive but one in[Dm]heritance.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Joshua answered with a [Gm7]firm command,
[C]Go up into [Fmaj7]the forest land,
[Bb]Clear ground in the land [Gm7]of Perizzites,
[Am]Where the Rephaim [Dm]dwell in old days.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
