{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
Then Joshua spoke to Ep[Gm7]hraim and Manasseh,
[C]You have great strength and [Fmaj7]power immense,
[Bb]The hill country shall be [Gm7]yours to take,
[Am]Though it is forest, clear it [Dm]well.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
It shall be yours to its [Gm7]farthest limits,
[C]Drive out the Canaanites who [Fmaj7]stay,
[Bb]Even with iron [Gm7]chariots strong,
[Am]You will make the land your [Dm]own.
